{
  "title": "ElastiCache · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "Redis OSS·Valkey·Memcached 계열의 관리형 인메모리 캐시다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>ElastiCache</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#valkey\">Valkey</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#redis-oss\">Redis OSS</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#memcached\">Memcached</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#serverless-and-node-based-clusters\">Serverless and Node-based Clusters</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#shards-and-replicas\">Shards and Replicas</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#cache-aside-and-write-through\">Cache-aside and Write-through</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#eviction-and-ttl\">Eviction and TTL</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#durability-backup-and-security\">Durability, Backup and Security</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>22 / 62</span></div><h1>ElastiCache</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 8 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>ElastiCache는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#valkey\">Valkey</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#redis-oss\">Redis OSS</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#memcached\">Memcached</a> 기반의 관리형 In-memory 서비스를 제공한다. 자주 읽는 데이터의 지연과 Database 부하를 줄이지만 Cache Miss·만료·장애 시 동작을 앱에서 설계해야 한다.</p><p>Engine, Serverless·Node 기반 배포, Sharding·Replication·Durability를 따로 비교한다. 모든 Cache가 같은 자료구조와 Persistence·Failover 기능을 지원하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Cache-aside의 Hit와 Miss\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Cache-aside의 Hit와 Miss</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Cache hit</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Application</strong><small>Key 조회</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>ElastiCache</strong><small>유효한 Value 발견</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Response</strong><small>Database 읽기 감소</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Cache miss</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Application</strong><small>Key 없음·만료</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Database</strong><small>원본 읽기</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Cache + Response</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a>로 저장 후 응답</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Invalidation·Eviction·장애 시 원본 부하를 설계한다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Choice</th><th scope=\"col\">Best fit</th><th scope=\"col\">Check</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#valkey\">Valkey</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#redis-oss\">Redis OSS</a></td><td>자료구조·Replication</td><td>Version / Durability / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#shards-and-replicas\">Cluster Mode</a></td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#memcached\">Memcached</a></td><td>단순 분산 Cache</td><td>Persistence / 기능 차이</td></tr><tr><td>Serverless</td><td>가변 수요·관리 최소화</td><td>지원 Feature / 과금</td></tr><tr><td>Node-based</td><td>Topology·Node 제어</td><td>Shard / Replica / 패치</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"valkey\"><h2>Valkey<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#valkey\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Redis 계열 호환의 Open Source Engine이며 다양한 자료구조·Replication·지원 Persistence 기능을 제공한다. 현재 ElastiCache의 권장 선택지를 비교할 때 포함한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#redis-oss\">Redis OSS</a> Version과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>·Module 호환 조건은 실제 Workload로 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"redis-oss\"><h2>Redis OSS <span class=\"full-name\">(Open Source Software)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#redis-oss\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>String·Hash·List·Set 등 자료구조와 지원 Pub/Sub·Transaction 기능을 제공한다. 지원 Replication Group·Failover로 가용성을 설계한다. Cache Cluster 자체의 Backup·복원과 원본 Database의 Backup은 별도다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"memcached\"><h2>Memcached<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#memcached\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>단순 Key-value Cache와 수평 분산에 적합하다. 일반적으로 복잡한 자료구조나 Redis 계열의 Replication·Persistence 요구에는 다른 Engine을 비교한다. Node 기반과 Serverless의 가용성·관리 모델을 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"serverless-and-node-based-clusters\"><h2>Serverless and Node-based Clusters<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#serverless-and-node-based-clusters\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Serverless는 Capacity 관리 부담을 줄이고 Node 기반은 Node Type·Shard·Replica를 더 직접 설정한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 연결·Security·Engine 기능의 지원 차이를 확인한다. Serverless라는 이름이 모든 사용량에서 가장 낮은 비용을 보장하지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"shards-and-replicas\"><h2>Shards and Replicas<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#shards-and-replicas\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Shard는 데이터를 나누어 용량·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>을 확장하고 Replica는 복제·읽기·Failover를 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#shards-and-replicas\">Cluster Mode</a>에서 Key 분산과 Multi-key Operation 제약을 고려한다. Replica만 늘려 단일 Shard의 모든 쓰기 병목을 해결할 수는 없다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cache-aside-and-write-through\"><h2>Cache-aside and Write-through<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#cache-aside-and-write-through\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#cache-aside-and-write-through\">Cache-aside</a>는 Miss 때 원본을 읽고 Cache에 채우며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#cache-aside-and-write-through\">Write-through</a>는 쓰기 때 Cache도 갱신한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a>·Invalidation으로 오래된 데이터를 관리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#cache-aside-and-write-through\">Cache Stampede</a>를 막으려면 만료 분산·Lock·미리 갱신 같은 앱 전략을 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"eviction-and-ttl\"><h2>Eviction and TTL <span class=\"full-name\">(Time to Live)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#eviction-and-ttl\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Memory가 부족하면 설정된 Eviction Policy에 따라 Key가 제거될 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a> 만료와 Eviction은 서로 다른 원인이다. Hit Rate·Memory·Eviction·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Latency</a>를 관찰해 용량과 Cache 정책을 조정한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"durability-backup-and-security\"><h2>Durability, Backup and Security<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#durability-backup-and-security\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>기존 Cache 사용은 원본 데이터에서 재구성 가능하도록 설계한다. 현재 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#valkey\">Valkey</a> Node 기반 구성에는 Transaction Log를 활용한 Durability 선택지도 있으므로 기능을 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a>·At-rest Encryption·인증·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>과 Backup 지원을 확인한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>상품 상세 조회를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#cache-aside-and-write-through\">Cache-aside</a>로 처리하고 가격 변경 때 해당 Key를 무효화한다. Cache 장애 시 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>로 요청이 몰리는 상황까지 용량·제한 정책을 준비한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>일반 Cache는 원본에서 재구성 가능하게 설계한다. 최신 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/#valkey\">Valkey</a>의 선택적 Durability 기능은 지원 배포·Engine 조건을 별도로 확인한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonElastiCache/latest/dg/WhatIs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonElastiCache/latest/dg/WhatIs.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q060/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q060\" data-question=\"Q060\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q060</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q060/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Repeated reads of the same product data make database responses slow. Which in-memory layer can cache the data with a short TTL?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon ElastiCache</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">ElastiCache</a>가 빈번한 읽기를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 부담을 줄인다. 무효화와 장애 시 원본 접근도 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">ElastiCache</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q105\" data-question=\"Q105\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q105</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q105/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A frequently viewed dashboard queries an RDS data source. The company wants faster visualizations and fewer repeated queries against the source database. Which Quick Sight dataset mode is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Direct Query</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">SPICE</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS Snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS FIFO</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">SPICE</a>는 데이터를 메모리 기반 엔진에 가져와 반복적인 분석 쿼리를 빠르게 처리한다. 원본의 변경 사항은 데이터 세트 새로 고침으로 반영한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q106\" data-question=\"Q106\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q106</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q106/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A Quick Sight dashboard must query the underlying database when viewers open or interact with it, rather than rely on a periodically refreshed imported copy. Which dataset mode should the architect select?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">SPICE</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Direct Query</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Direct Query</a>는 대시보드를 사용할 때 원본 데이터 소스를 조회한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">SPICE</a>는 가져온 데이터의 새로 고침이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q054\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q055\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">이전 용어 <b>Elastic IP</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">다음 용어 <b>ELB / ALB / NLB</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
